OL,3,GNEWSAScramble for new NHS dentist as
OL,4,A14,000 join queue
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 14,000 people have registered
OL,7,Fonline to join a dental practice, after
OL,8,Fit began offering NHS appointments for
OL,9,Fthe first time.
OL,11,FStaff at Bridlington Dental Studio,
OL,12,Fwhich will offer 5,000 appointments per
OL,13,Fyear to NHS patients, said they were
OL,14,Ftaking about 70 phone calls a day from
OL,15,Fthose who wanted to be added to the
OL,16,Fwaiting list.
OL,18,FBethany Sleeman, a manager for the
OL,19,Fpractice's parent group, described the
OL,20,Fresponse as "shocking", but "not
OL,21,Fsurprising", in an area previously
OL,22,Fdescribed as a dental desert.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
