OL,3,GNEWSAScramble for new NHS dentist as
OL,4,A14,000 join queue
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo NHS practices closed in the coastal
OL,7,Ftown in 2022, leaving only a single
OL,8,Fdentist offering subsidised care in a
OL,9,Ftown of 35,000 people.
